This plugin vendors the html-plan runtime and its references, written by Thariq Shihipar
and published in Anthropic's community plugin repo:

    https://github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-community/tree/f60f0454df3045f724c43c6346ec80bdcc3472b2/html-plan

Upstream commit:

    f60f0454df3045f724c43c6346ec80bdcc3472b2

Upstream `html-plan/.claude-plugin/plugin.json` says `"license": "MIT"`, but the repository
carries one licence file, `LICENSE`, and it is the Apache License 2.0. This plugin treats the
vendored files as Apache-2.0 and reproduces that licence in full at the end of this file.

Upstream LICENSE SHA-256:

    cfc7749b96f63bd31c3c42b5c471bf756814053e847c10f3eb003417bc523d30

Only skills/doc/ is vendored, and inside it only runtime/, references/ and examples/. The
skill's own SKILL.md is first-party: upstream's SKILL.md becomes references/plan.md through
patch 0002, which the doc skill loads for the plan kind. The upstream plugin manifest and
README are deliberately not carried.

